        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    purchase_price = 95000\n    face_value = 100000\n    num_periods = 4\n    coupon_rate = 5\n    market_rate = 6\n\n    book_value = purchase_price\n    total_amortization = 0\n\n    for _ in range(num_periods):\n        coupon_payment = face_value * coupon_rate / 100\n        interest_expense = book_value * market_rate / 100\n        amortization = interest_expense - coupon_payment\n        total_amortization += amortization\n        book_value += amortization\n\n    answer = round(total_amortization)\n    return answer\n```",
